diff --git a/releasenotes/notes/wait-exponential-jitter-multiplier-5c7d2e9a1f40b813.yaml b/releasenotes/notes/wait-exponential-jitter-multiplier-5c7d2e9a1f40b813.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bee53f3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/wait-exponential-jitter-multiplier-5c7d2e9a1f40b813.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Add ``multiplier`` parameter to ``wait_exponential_jitter`` (default 1),
+    with the same meaning as in ``wait_exponential`` and the other exponential
+    wait strategies.
+deprecations:
+  - |
+    The ``initial`` parameter of ``wait_exponential_jitter`` is deprecated in
+    favour of ``multiplier``. Passing ``initial`` (by keyword or positionally)
+    still works but emits a ``DeprecationWarning``. Passing both ``initial`` and
+    ``multiplier`` raises ``ValueError``.
